   "size": 28,
   "comment": "INVENTED NAME. A skeleton: a SKELnnnn entry of a level bundle, registered in SkeletonTable (0x1d7578) by AnimSkeletonProcess. Variable length: 16 + 12*numBones, padded to 32. No hierarchy - that is in each skin.",
